artisan-hint-fermenter = Load three matching plants; beer also needs water in Pour mode. After fermentation the barrel switches to Draw mode: click it with a container in hand. The container controls the amount. The barrel stays locked during fermentation.
artisan-hint-bottler = Load a drink container and empty bottles. Select the source, apply a dose and batch name, then start bottling.
